{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018kLZtFVhGhVbpyYKvhDMbs","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Cloudflare Agents SDK CLI terminal client chat with agent\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"agents-sdkby Cloudflare\",\"url\":\"https://mcpservers.org/agent-skills/cloudflare/agents-sdk\"},{\"title\":\"How to integrate Cloudflare MCP with Claude Agent SDK\",\"url\":\"https://composio.dev/toolkits/cloudflare/framework/claude-agents-sdk\"},{\"title\":\"How to integrate Cloudflare MCP with OpenAI Agents SDK\",\"url\":\"https://composio.dev/toolkits/cloudflare/framework/open-ai-agents-sdk\"},{\"title\":\"cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com:2053/agents\"},{\"title\":\"FrameworksCloudflare Agents\",\"url\":\"https://www.assistant-ui.com/docs/integrations/frameworks/cloudflare-agents/overview\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/communication-channels/chat/client-sdk/index.md\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/index.md\"},{\"title\":\"From cloudflare\",\"url\":\"https://www.claudepluginhub.com/skills/jadeleafhq-cloudflare/agents-sdk\"},{\"title\":\"From cloudflare\",\"url\":\"https://www.claudepluginhub.com/skills/cloudflare-cloudflare/agents-sdk\"},{\"title\":\"06755db4.preview.developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://06755db4.preview.developers.cloudflare.com/agents\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up a dedicated Cloudflare Agents SDK CLI or terminal chat client. The closest match is a non-React client in the SDK's docs.\n\n- **Vanilla client:** Cloudflare's client docs describe an `AgentClient` class in `agents/client` that connects to an agent by name and host, and can call agent methods. It is usable without React, so a Node script could in principle drive it from a terminal. That is my inference, not something the results state.\n- **Chat UI path:** The documented chat route is React-oriented. @cloudflare/ai-chat's useAgentChat returns a structural extension of the AI SDK's useChat.\n- **Starter template:** The official starter is a web app, not a terminal client. Its install is npx create-cloudflare@latest --template cloudflare/agents-starter, followed by a dev server run.\n- **Unrelated hits:** The Composio pages show terminal chat loops, but they wrap the Claude and OpenAI Agents SDKs around Cloudflare's MCP servers, not Cloudflare's Agents SDK.\n\nTo confirm, I'd check the Cloudflare docs for `agents/client` usage in Node, or look for a CLI or terminal example in the `cloudflare/agents` GitHub repo.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7e1f3cf5-6715-4bd7-afba-50ec633c4977","uuid":"4d424e4d-32e5-4cfa-b8ea-202c8bb2d178","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:14:01.531Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Cloudflare Agents SDK CLI terminal client chat with agent","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01VBqTedP17N8uLPHKduazuQ","content":[{"title":"agents-sdkby Cloudflare","url":"https://mcpservers.org/agent-skills/cloudflare/agents-sdk"},{"title":"How to integrate Cloudflare MCP with Claude Agent SDK","url":"https://composio.dev/toolkits/cloudflare/framework/claude-agents-sdk"},{"title":"How to integrate Cloudflare MCP with OpenAI Agents SDK","url":"https://composio.dev/toolkits/cloudflare/framework/open-ai-agents-sdk"},{"title":"cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com:2053/agents"},{"title":"FrameworksCloudflare Agents","url":"https://www.assistant-ui.com/docs/integrations/frameworks/cloudflare-agents/overview"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/communication-channels/chat/client-sdk/index.md"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/index.md"},{"title":"From cloudflare","url":"https://www.claudepluginhub.com/skills/jadeleafhq-clou